0 22 642 [
[(Besides floats, scalars can have other data types, namely: symbols, text and)]
[(arrays. This example shows how to deal with symbols and text. A text can have many)]
[(lines with lists of one or more elements \050symbols and/or floats\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
