/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 22 593 [
[(Unlike float fields, that you can set when adding an item with [append], you can)]
[(only use the [set] object to set symbol values and the [text set] object to set)]
[(texts. When setting a symbol with [set], you need the "-symbol" flag and you can't)]
[(set floats and symbols with the same [set] object. For [text], you need to use the)]
[("-s" flag to deal with Data Structures. Check also the help file of [text] to see)]
[(how to use [text get] to get values from text fields.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
